<title>CHINA: China premier to visit Malaysia, Singapore.</title>
<headline>China premier to visit Malaysia, Singapore.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's Premier Li Peng is to visit Malaysia and Singapore later this month, state radio said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Li is to visit Malaysia and Singapore from August 21 to 26, the radio said. It gave no further details.</p>
</text>
